| Files over 2GB with the 64-bit file interface: creates a 3GB file
| LargeTest here, checks seeking, sizes and data past 2GB, then deletes it.
| Needs 3GB free on a filing system with files over 2GB (FileCore on
| RISC OS 5, FAT32) and some minutes. Must print PASS.
Set UST$Dir <Obey$Dir>
WimpSlot -min 8000K
Run <UST$Dir>.largefile /<UST$Dir>/LargeTest
